      en: ["Central trading post for fruits and vegetables in the Malkerns Valley.", "Major distribution point for the region's large-scale pineapple production.", "Development is closely linked to irrigation projects started in the 1950s.", "Strategically located along the MR103 main road.", "Provides a livelihood for hundreds of local small-scale farmers.", "Regarded as one of the oldest continuously operating markets in the country."],
